==Rules==
{{StageRule|Summer}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**8 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

